---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy';
const description =
  'How Restaurant Tip Calculator currently handles calculator inputs, browser storage, fonts, advertising, and analytics.';

const nav = [
  { href: '/', label: 'Calculator' },
  { href: '/about/', label: 'About' },
  { href: '/methodology/', label: 'Methodology' },
];

const jsonLd = JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  '@id': 'https://restauranttipcalculator.com/privacy/#breadcrumb',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Restaurant Tip Calculator', item: 'https://restauranttipcalculator.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Privacy', item: 'https://restauranttipcalculator.com/privacy/' },
  ],
});
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} path="/privacy/" jsonLd={jsonLd} nav={nav}>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="guide-intro"><a href="/">Restaurant tip calculator</a> / Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This page describes the site's current Phase-3 behavior: a static calculator site with no live advertising or
      analytics scripts installed.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="calculator-data">
    <h2>Calculator values stay in your browser</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Bill amounts, tax, fees, people count, and calculated results are processed by JavaScript in your browser. The
        calculator does not send those values to a custom server for calculation, and no account is required.
      </p>
      <p>
        The calculator uses localStorage for a small set of preferences: the selected tip setting, the tax-in-tip-basis
        option, and the whole-dollar round-up option. It does not intentionally store bill history or the amounts you
        type into the bill, tax, delivery-fee, or other-fee fields.
      </p>
      <p>
        If advertising is enabled in a future build, the current ad-ready shell can also remember a closed mobile ad
        anchor for the browser session. Advertising is disabled in the current launch-ready configuration.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="external-resources">
    <h2>External resources and current tracking</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The site currently loads Fraunces and Spline Sans Mono from Google Fonts to preserve the intended typography.
        Loading those font resources creates requests to Google's font infrastructure and can expose ordinary request
        information such as an IP address, browser information, and referrer data to that provider.
      </p>
      <p>
        No live advertising vendor, analytics platform, tag manager, tracking pixel, or account system is installed in
        this Phase-3 build. The site also does not call an external API to perform calculator math.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="future-changes">
    <h2>Before advertising or analytics are enabled</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This privacy page must be reviewed and updated before enabling third-party advertising, analytics, or other
        tracking technologies that materially change data handling. Any consent mechanism should be based on the
        technologies actually deployed and the jurisdictions served, not added as a placeholder.
      </p>
      <p>This page is a plain-language description of current site behavior, not legal advice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
